      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Susceptible to Mockery",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "A character can attempt to Feint or Demoralize Rumin by mocking the fact that he hasn't yet been turned into a vampire. On a success, in addition to the normal effects, Rumin becomes Sickened 1 (or Sickened 3 on a critical success), but on a critical failure he becomes enraged and gains a +1 status bonus to Strikes and damage rolls against foes for 1 minute, during which time he can't be mocked further.\n\nEffect: Susceptible to Mockery (Critical Failure)"
    },
